  m_text: "Top Down Tileset Sandy Desert - by alb_Pixel\r\n\r\n\thttps://alb-pixel-store.itch.io/sandy-desert-top-down-tileset\r\n\r\nTop
    Down Tileset Red Desert - by alb_Pixel\r\n\thttps://alb-pixel-store.itch.io/red-desert-top-down-assets\r\n\r\n\r\nWild
    West Pixel Assets by dani567\r\n\thttps://dani567.itch.io/wild-west-pixel-art-assets\r\n\t\r\nUser
    Interface UI Medieval by ToffeeCraft\r\n\thttps://toffeecraft.itch.io/ui-user-interface-medieval\r\n\r\nTop
    Down - Mobs - Dog by Admurin \r\n\thttps://admurin.itch.io/top-down-mobs-dog\r\n\r\n2D
    Top-Down Pixel Art Tileset: Casino by Game Between The Lines\r\n\thttps://gamebetweenthelines.itch.io/2d-top-down-pixel-art-tileset-casino\r\n\r\n\r\nPixel
    Poker Play Set - Cards, Chips, Dice by Biscuitlocker\r\n\thttps://biscuitlocker.itch.io/pixel-poker-play-set-cards-chips-dice\r\n\r\nPixel
    Cards Free by Nikoichu\r\n\thttps://nikoichu.itch.io/pixel-cards-free\r\n\r\nFree
    Skill 32x32 Cyberpunk Icons Pixel Art by Free and Premium Game Assets (GUI, Sprite,
